      },
      "content": "This CNC lathe contains three major elements - Body of machine, the Electric Control Panel, Hydraulic Unit, and etc. and each of them is connected with wires and hydraulic pipes."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0308",
      "reading_order": 406,
      "section": "1. General",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.22051600000003,
        "t": 690.914864,
        "r": 527.3179739999988,
        "b": 665.0031329281768
      },
      "content": "Sine all devices are attached to the body of machine, you can move it as necessary without overhauling the machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0309",
      "reading_order": 407,
      "section": "1. General",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.22051600000003,
        "t": 656.89496,
        "r": 342.90889199999964,
        "b": 648.0232409281768
      },
      "content": "There are 2 methods of moving by crane or fork lift."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0310",
      "reading_order": 408,
      "section": "1. General",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.22051600000003,
        "t": 639.915068,
        "r": 527.3470320000002,
        "b": 614.0033369281769
      },
      "content": "To achieve the desired working, you should follow the installation procedures given in this manual."
    },
